
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
C2 · Request options (timeout, progress) and the client-side error taxonomy
SDK: RequestOptions.timeout, RequestOptions.onprogress, RequestOptions.resetTimeoutOnProgress, RequestOptions.maxTotalTimeout, ProtocolError, SdkError
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

── Timeouts — job = 8 batches × 150 ms ≈ 1.2 s ───────────────────────────────

▶ A. timeout 400 ms → times out
  callTool(params, options)({"name":"export_transcripts","arguments":{"batches":8,"delayMs":150},"options":{"timeout":400}})
  ✖ 410ms → SdkError (code REQUEST_TIMEOUT): Request timed out

▶ B. timeout 400 ms + resetTimeoutOnProgress → each update restarts the clock
  callTool(params, options)({"name":"export_transcripts","arguments":{"batches":8,"delayMs":150},"options":{"timeout":400,"resetTimeoutOnProgress":true}})
  ✔ 1226ms → 
    {
      "text": "Exported 8 batches",
      "progressUpdates": 8
    }

▶ C. same + maxTotalTimeout 700 ms → hard cap wins
  callTool(params, options)({"name":"export_transcripts","arguments":{"batches":8,"delayMs":150},"options":{"timeout":400,"resetTimeoutOnProgress":true,"maxTotalTimeout":700}})
  ✖ 763ms → SdkError (code REQUEST_TIMEOUT): Maximum total timeout exceeded

▶ D. default timeout (60 s) → completes
  callTool(params, options)({"name":"export_transcripts","arguments":{"batches":8,"delayMs":150},"options":{}})
  ✔ 1219ms → 
    {
      "text": "Exported 8 batches",
      "progressUpdates": 8
    }

── Failure taxonomy — where does each failure show up? ───────────────────────

▶ Handler reports a business error (unknown student)
  classify()
  ✔ 4ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Handler reports a business error (unknown student)",
      "surfacesAs": "result.isError = true",
      "detail": "No student with student_id \"9999999\". Use search_students to find the right ID."
    }

▶ Arguments fail the tool inputSchema
  classify()
  ✔ 3ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Arguments fail the tool inputSchema",
      "surfacesAs": "result.isError = true",
      "detail": "Input validation error: Invalid arguments for tool calculate_gpa: student_id: Invalid input: expected string, "
    }

▶ Tool name does not exist
  classify()
  ✔ 3ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Tool name does not exist",
      "surfacesAs": "throws ProtocolError (-32602)",
      "detail": "Tool delete_everything not found"
    }

▶ Prompt arguments fail argsSchema
  classify()
  ✔ 3ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Prompt arguments fail argsSchema",
      "surfacesAs": "throws ProtocolError (-32602)",
      "detail": "Invalid arguments for prompt class_report: class_id: Invalid input: expected string, received undefined"
    }

▶ Resource URI not found
  classify()
  ✔ 3ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Resource URI not found",
      "surfacesAs": "throws ProtocolError (-32602)",
      "detail": "Unknown student \"0000000\""
    }

▶ Method not available in this protocol era (ping on 2026)
  classify()
  ✔ 0ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Method not available in this protocol era (ping on 2026)",
      "surfacesAs": "throws SdkError (METHOD_NOT_SUPPORTED_BY_PROTOCOL_VERSION)",
      "detail": "Method 'ping' is not supported by the negotiated protocol version (wire era 2026-07-28)"
    }

▶ Connection already closed
  classify()
  ✔ 4ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Connection already closed",
      "surfacesAs": "throws Error",
      "detail": "Not connected"
    }

▶ Request timeout
  classify()
  ✔ 101ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Request timeout",
      "surfacesAs": "throws SdkError (REQUEST_TIMEOUT)",
      "detail": "Request timed out"
    }

▶ Capability the server never advertised (prompts on a tools-only server)
  classify()
Client.listPrompts() called but server does not advertise prompts capability - returning empty list
  ✔ 0ms → 
    {
      "failure": "Capability the server never advertised (prompts on a tools-only server)",
      "surfacesAs": "normal result",
      "detail": "{\"prompts\":[]}"
    }

── Summary ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
┌─────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ (index) │ failure                                                      │ surfacesAs                                                   │
